1
00:00:03,208 --> 00:00:06,512
Every year-end audit runs on a long list of client

2
00:00:06,512 --> 00:00:09,618
requests, and nobody can see all of it at once.

3
00:00:10,068 --> 00:00:13,828
Evidence Room turns that list into a card catalogue:

4
00:00:13,828 --> 00:00:17,298
one drawer per audit area, one card per request.

5
00:00:18,426 --> 00:00:21,887
Red tabs are overdue, paper clips are open queries, and

6
00:00:21,887 --> 00:00:25,286
the brass strip fills as the auditor accepts evidence.

7
00:00:26,094 --> 00:00:28,819
Switch the lens to ageing, and the same

8
00:00:28,819 --> 00:00:31,054
cards show how late each one is.

9
00:00:31,855 --> 00:00:35,687
Today ranks what needs attention; this one opens Revenue and

10
00:00:35,687 --> 00:00:39,135
lifts out the bad debt provision, seventeen days late.

11
00:00:39,941 --> 00:00:44,721
View as auditor, and only the submissions waiting for review stay lit.

12
00:00:47,153 --> 00:00:50,734
Sam owns that request. From his Today, the reading

13
00:00:50,734 --> 00:00:54,243
desk shows the card, its evidence and its thread.

14
00:00:54,693 --> 00:00:57,476
Adding the first evidence moves the card to

15
00:00:57,476 --> 00:01:00,583
in progress; submitting sends it to the auditor.

16
00:01:05,612 --> 00:01:08,946
As the lead auditor, the returns trolley lists

17
00:01:08,946 --> 00:01:12,642
every submission, oldest first, to accept or query.

18
00:01:13,092 --> 00:01:17,102
Only auditors get these buttons, and a query needs a real question.

19
00:01:17,913 --> 00:01:20,195
Back in the catalogue, the card wears

20
00:01:20,195 --> 00:01:22,663
its paper clip until the client answers.

21
00:01:25,898 --> 00:01:29,068
On a new request slip, the room shows what was

22
00:01:29,068 --> 00:01:33,548
already asked, so the same reconciliation is not requested twice.

23
00:01:34,357 --> 00:01:39,149
The shelf list is the pack for the weekly audit meeting:

24
00:01:39,149 --> 00:01:43,427
progress and ageing by area, as a CSV or on paper.

25
00:01:44,235 --> 00:01:48,405
One room for both sides, and every request where everyone can see it.
